{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LA: Streets of Sorcery</strong> is a detective visual novel where magic, humor, and sex collide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a young man joining the Department of Illegal Sorcery of the Ministry of Magic. Your new partner, a sharp-tongued brunette, may cause more chaos than the criminals you\u2019re chasing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913950/extras/fca915685f825794fadafa5b6030c5e3.poster.avif?t=1771846498\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913950/extras/fca915685f825794fadafa5b6030c5e3.webm?t=1771846498\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913950/extras/fca915685f825794fadafa5b6030c5e3.mp4?t=1771846498\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each chapter presents a new case, blending\u00a0<strong>mystery, humor, and adult scenes</strong>. Your choices shape the investigation, the romance, and even the ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique World</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An urban fantasy setting where magic and mages live among us, carefully hidden from the public eye</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913950/extras/794d8bb7cc82965be26fc538e6f80980.poster.avif?t=1771846498\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913950/extras/794d8bb7cc82965be26fc538e6f80980.webm?t=1771846498\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913950/extras/794d8bb7cc82965be26fc538e6f80980.mp4?t=1771846498\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Investigations</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather evidence in hidden-object mini-games where every clue matters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a detective board to connect suspects, clues, and testimonies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One-on-one spell battles during arrests</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Read minds during interrogations</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913950/extras/566aebe120a9a41edcebf48faea9679b.poster.avif?t=1771846498\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913950/extras/566aebe120a9a41edcebf48faea9679b.webm?t=1771846498\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913950/extras/566aebe120a9a41edcebf48faea9679b.mp4?t=1771846498\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relationships &amp; Social Life</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dating sim mechanics with loyalty and branching dialogue</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose how to spend your free time: bowling nights, bar parties, or intimate dates</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Romantic storylines with multiple outcomes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mature content unlocked through trust and intimacy</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913950/extras/f821f0d0f46967341f261e439e954762.poster.avi